  "title": "National Minimum Wage and National Living Wage rates",
  "details": {
    "body": "<p>The hourly rate for the minimum wage depends on your age.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"current-rates\">Current rates</h2>\n\n<p>The rates change on 1 April every year.</p>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <td></td>\n      <th scope=\"col\">21 and over</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">18 to 20</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Under 18</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Apprentice</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"row\">April 2026</th>\n      <td>\u00a312.71</td>\n      <td>\u00a310.85</td>\n      <td>\u00a38</td>\n      <td>\u00a38</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"previous-rates\">Previous rates</h2>\n\n<h3 id=\"rates-between-1-april-2024-and-31-march-2026\">Rates between 1 April 2024 and 31 March 2026</h3>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <td></td>\n      <th scope=\"col\">21 and over</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">18 to 20</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Under 18</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Apprentice</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"row\">April 2025 to March 2026</th>\n      <td>\u00a312.21</td>\n      <td>\u00a310\u00a0</td>\n      <td>\u00a37.55\u00a0</td>\n      <td>\u00a37.55\u00a0</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h3 id=\"rates-between-1-april-2021-and-31-march-2024\">Rates between 1 April 2021 and 31 March 2024</h3>\n\n<p>Between 1 April 2021 and 31 March 2024 the National Living Wage was for those aged 23 and over.</p>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <td></td>\n      <th scope=\"col\">23 and over</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">21 to 22</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">18 to 20</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Under 18</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Apprentice</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"row\">April 2023 to March 2024</th>\n      <td>\u00a310.42</td>\n      <td>\u00a310.18</td>\n      <td>\u00a37.49</td>\n      <td>\u00a35.28</td>\n      <td>\u00a35.28</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"row\">April 2022 to March 2023</th>\n      <td>\u00a39.50</td>\n      <td>\u00a39.18</td>\n      <td>\u00a36.83</td>\n      <td>\u00a34.81</td>\n      <td>\u00a34.81</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h3 id=\"rates-before-1-april-2021\">Rates before 1 April 2021</h3>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <td></td>\n      <th scope=\"col\">25 and over</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">21 to 24</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">18 to 20</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Under 18</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Apprentice</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"row\">April 2019 to March 2020</th>\n      <td>\u00a38.21</td>\n      <td>\u00a37.70</td>\n      <td>\u00a36.15</td>\n      <td>\u00a34.35</td>\n      <td>\u00a33.90</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n"
  }
}
